From fed424ba46c865dca1c202b19ce7c37d0e335408 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexey Lapin <a.lapin03@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 16:27:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(server): add hone.status and hone.feedback RPCs

hone.status reports which AGENTS.md version the Hone service serves and how
full its next optimization batch is; an unreachable Hone reads as
reachable:false. hone.feedback resolves a thread's Pi session from the stored
projection, derives Hone's trace id, and posts rated feedback text.

